<https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#Geometry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The taxonomy of geometry includes the GIS geometry data of M150-Components. These include Geometry Object and Geometry Points.\n\nIt is recommended to create individuals for geometric objects with the template:\n\n` GeoObject[PipeSection/Node Designation] `\n` GeoObject[HG001]  ` for Pipe Section: Geometry Objects;\n` GeoObject[KG001] ` for Node: Geometry Objects.\n\nIt is recommended to create individuals for geometric points with the template:\n\n` GeoPoint[Geometry Point Description] `\n` GeoPoint[GP001]  `.\n\n`GeoObject`'s should be declared as the parent of 'GeoPoint''s with the object property `isParentOf`. (Inverse: isChildOf)\n\n`GeoObject`'s should be declared as the renderer of a Component with the object property 'renders'. (Inverse: renderedBy)"@en .
